*.pyc

# Secrets for scripts/watch_notify.py — never commit
.env
.env.local

# Reel media staged for Instagram publishing — deliberately NOT committed.
# The whole repo history is 6MB; one batch of Reels is 33MB, so committing
# them would grow it by ~560MB a year and git never forgets a blob.
# scripts/ig_manifest.py stages them here, and they are hosted elsewhere.
# See the note at the top of that script for where.
media/reels/
